sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 使用者
    participant Main as main.py (CLI/入口)
    participant Graph as graph.py (Agent Orchestration)
    participant Nodes as nodes.py (RAG/LLM/工具)
    participant State as state.py (AgentState)

    User->>Main: 輸入查詢
    Main->>State: 更新 AgentState（messages, query...）
    Main->>Graph: 傳遞 AgentState
    Graph->>Nodes: 調用工具/agent node（RAG, LLM, API）
    Nodes->>State: 更新 AgentState（檢索、生成、工具結果）
    Graph->>Main: 回傳更新後的 AgentState
    Main->>User: 顯示最終回應